# EmailJS configuration for the contact form (free tier: https://www.emailjs.com/)
# 1. Create a free EmailJS account and add an email service (Gmail works).
# 2. Create an email template with these variables:
#    {{from_name}} {{phone}} {{reply_to}} {{message}} {{submitted_at}} {{to_email}}
#    Set the template's "To Email" to focuszonelibrary1@gmail.com
# 3. Copy the values below from your EmailJS dashboard and restart the dev server.
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key
